  "interpretations": [
    "Both variants ran sequentially on the same existing public Chiado chain/registry with the same recorded settlement/timing settings and contract artifact identities. This is not the earlier native Gnosis fixture.",
    "Each variant settled 120 measured sources plus two unmeasured warmup sources; setup deployments and one ordinary setup barrier per variant are excluded from measured totals.",
    "Observed candidate paid posts/blobs were 7/7 versus baseline 8/8. The two profiles encountered skipped L1 slots in different phases; timing differences are not randomized causal speedup estimates.",
    "Candidate preserved the exact ordered 24-source snapshot across its skipped-slot retry. Canonical headers prove the missing slot, the retention event reports 24, and all 24 later reconcile under generation 13 into one exact Sync/post.",
    "Candidate inbound-reused arrived just after the prior empty Sync decision, so it waited for the next finite snapshot; its 8.071-second median includes about 4.98 seconds before selection, while preparation was 192 ms.",
    "Baseline backlog began at 60 unsettled L2 blocks; candidate began at 65. Both satisfy the configured 60..65 readiness window, but their history and slot alignment differ.",
    "Recorded post execution prices were 1.000000007 gwei in baseline versus 1.200000007 gwei in candidate. Blob prices also varied. Thus fewer blobs/less total measured gas did not mean lower paid xDAI in this run.",
    "All cost totals come from verified canonical receipts and include user-funded L1 companions; they are not poster-wallet expenditure. No receipt appeared for the two skipped attempts at collection, and those attempts are excluded from paid-post totals.",
    "Source receipt histories preserve provisional replacements. Baseline mixed-fresh initially failed the harness unsafe-receipt immutability check; read-only recollection refreshed the final canonical receipts without resending sources and retained the original artifact/failure.",
    "Original ingress harness hashes remain preserved. Baseline early phases used b2d7b4...; subsequent baseline phases and all candidate phases used the receipt-aware dbd2ab6... harness. Read-only baseline mixed verification is separately identified.",
    "The initial five-block setup-readiness assumption was corrected to 30 before timed sources; the successful baseline setup was not repeated. The final measured plan identity is the same for both profiles.",
    "The live follower was not run. Prior passing independent native follower tests are separate evidence. Public-chain canonicality is as revalidated at collection, not a guarantee against future reorganization.",
    "These 12/24-source waves did not exercise a gas/blob admission cut. They validate complete grouping and the skipped-slot fix, but do not measure maximum capacity or isolate the DA admission-accounting change.",
    "The fee quote logs prove the proximal pricing cause: RPC estimate 0 plus 20% then the 1-gwei floor in baseline; RPC estimate 1 gwei plus 20% in candidate. Both were freshly sampled at the canonical parent and matched signed transaction caps and paid receipts. Why the underlying estimator response changed is unresolved; neither aged runner user quotes nor a retry multiplier explains this difference."
  ],
